  "description": "Adds the AGM-180 Blackout microwave suppression cruise missile and CBU-82M Locust mine dispenser. Blackout emits for 20 seconds within 10 km of its remembered launch target and suppresses enemy ground electronics plus aircraft radar and datalink, including allies; recovery takes four seconds after last exposure. Locust deploys eight 7 kg HE mines using CCIP. Includes vanilla and selected mod-aircraft compatibility, excluding MiG-29. One DLL with an embedded Blueprinter bundle. Early testing release; requires Blueprinter 2.0.1 or newer.",
